  "description": "Windows Forms for .NET 10 on Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, iOS and in the browser (WebAssembly). The System.Windows.Forms API, with windowless controls drawn by System.Drawing.Managed: native backends for Windows (Win32), macOS (AppKit) and Linux (X11), SDL3 on Wayland, Android, iOS and the browser; themes, HiDPI, touch, RichTextBox with RTF and HTML, WebBrowser on the system web engine, printing, and the Wisej.NET modern controls.",
